{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A bullet-building roguelite where victory comes before you pull the trigger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/9359468e1d4128595de26c95f7b446a4.poster.avif?t=1770283936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/9359468e1d4128595de26c95f7b446a4.webm?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/9359468e1d4128595de26c95f7b446a4.mp4?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your home from shadowspawn invaders in this bullet-building roguelike! When a mystical rift unleashes waves of monsters, arm your Arcane Rifle and craft the ultimate magic ammunition to vanish them. From the Creators of &quot;Endgame of Devil&quot; comes their latest masterpiece! A gunslinger who crafts magic into every bullet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash the Storm &amp; Gather Power!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy you destroy releases the energy you\u2019ll need to forge new bullets. Clear waves, harvest power, and keep your finger on the trigger. The real battle begins when the smoke settles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/fe691080d38c49d6ec4426561b5276bd.poster.avif?t=1770283936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/fe691080d38c49d6ec4426561b5276bd.webm?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/fe691080d38c49d6ec4426561b5276bd.mp4?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge New Bullets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the energy you\u2019ve gathered to craft over <strong>220 unique bullets</strong>, each with distinct effects and elemental powers. Your next bullet could redefine your entire build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/d5d6e203dbbddff362210178baf53f61.poster.avif?t=1770283936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/d5d6e203dbbddff362210178baf53f61.webm?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/d5d6e203dbbddff362210178baf53f61.mp4?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mix &amp; Fuse for Maximum Impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange your bullets in the Arcane Magazine to trigger powerful synergies. Chain effects, amplify damage, build wild elemental combos and triple merge three identical bullets to get a new and more powerful version. Strategy starts long before you pull the trigger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/36a72545477356c014ad54f82dd7aeac.poster.avif?t=1770283936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/36a72545477356c014ad54f82dd7aeac.webm?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/36a72545477356c014ad54f82dd7aeac.mp4?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seal Your Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every wave, pick from <strong>150+ magical Seals</strong> to modify your bullets and abilities. Each run is a new experiment. Mix effects, evolve your loadout, and craft your build to <strong>become an unstoppable force.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/08f9f165ff99a2ab953bba187d888950.poster.avif?t=1770283936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/08f9f165ff99a2ab953bba187d888950.webm?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/08f9f165ff99a2ab953bba187d888950.mp4?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>-Game Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>3 Unique Playable Characters </strong>with distinct mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>220+ Bullet Types </strong>across 6 elemental attributes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>150+ Magical Seals </strong>with diverse enhancement effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>Bullet Fusion System</strong> merging three identical bullets for empowered versions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>13 Ancient Runes </strong>for strategic permanent upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>8 Magic Carpets </strong>offering unique gameplay styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>15 Waves of Escalating Challenges </strong>with Omens &amp; Megastructures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels </strong>catering to both casual and hardcore players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>Dimension Events </strong>to encounter mysterious visitors between battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>Endless Synergy Possibilities </strong>between bullets, seals, and runes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>Exquisite Pixel Art </strong>with impactful visual effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/340fd887eb09ce2840ec61921f11b11a.poster.avif?t=1770283936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/340fd887eb09ce2840ec61921f11b11a.webm?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/340fd887eb09ce2840ec61921f11b11a.mp4?t=1770283936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Magician Lv.1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2981070/52b82e2cd596fefc1f6cabe38e2d92a9aed83e1d.jpg"},{"name":"Magician Lv.2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2981070/d6699f3c71368b173bf26198db763c747cff8dc0.jpg"},{"name":"Magician Lv.3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2981070/1449207973a8644a4027b2ee343b6046f413aab4.jpg"},{"name":"Magician Lv.4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2981070/fcd4ab3ef21075b71fa60b807aa6ecb2701d84f2.jpg"},{"name":"Magician Lv.5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2981070/f5d219f3b0f313c40d7c8b2b4da92d32482e6f86.jpg"},{"name":"Magician Lv.6","path":"https://